ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":1769189320,"text":"では、ひとつ手伝ってくれるかしら？先に言っておくけど、協会の任務ではなく、私個人の依頼よ。","nextNodeIds":[221080107,221080108]},{"nodeId":221080107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3641021056,"text":"わかった。","nextNodeIds":[221080109]},{"nodeId":221080109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":2505647304,"text":"話が早いわね。でも詳細も聞かずに依頼を受けるのは賢い行動とは言えないわ。","nextNodeIds":[221080111]},{"nodeId":221080111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":2729329408,"text":"依頼の件だけど、大盾を持つヒルチャールを2体倒して欲しいの。","nextNodeIds":[221080112]},{"nodeId":221080112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":3353556096,"text":"そいつらの盾には「岩」属性の力がついてる。そんなに危険ではないけど、気を付けたほうがいいわ。","nextNodeIds":[221080113]},{"nodeId":221080113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":3832435992,"text":"あなたのするべきことはそいつらを倒すことよ。倒したら私のところに来て、相応しい報酬を支払うから。","nextNodeIds":[221080114]},{"nodeId":221080114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":2391398608,"text":"そうだ、もし「剣」に関する何かを見つけたら、持ってきなさい。","nextNodeIds":[221080115]},{"nodeId":221080115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":940670304,"text":"もしなかったらそれでいいわ。ヒルチャールを倒してくれればちゃんと報酬を支払うから、安心しなさい。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":221080108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":348252480,"text":"どういう依頼？","nextNodeIds":[221080110]},{"nodeId":221080110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2016,"speakerName":"嵐姉","textMapHash":3579505000,"text":"慎重な人ね、前にひどい目でも遭ったの？","nextNodeIds":[221080111]}]},{"talkId":2210802,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDe